    <item>
      <title>【图文踩坑】白嫖京东50W积分GLM5.2</title>
      <link>https://linux.do/t/topic/2494885</link>
      <guid>linux.do-topic-2494885</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 29 Jun 2026 07:09:09 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>
            &lt;p&gt;省流： joy code送的50W积分&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/1/b/2/1b248c9d14e36535e8e637bed2395852f8afd7a7.jpeg&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/3S7chI7cQB0iiBs1pWNMf1l4yKH.jpeg?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;1782717472993&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/1/b/2/1b248c9d14e36535e8e637bed2395852f8afd7a7_2_690x442.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;1782717472993&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;3S7chI7cQB0iiBs1pWNMf1l4yKH&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;442&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/1/b/2/1b248c9d14e36535e8e637bed2395852f8afd7a7_2_690x442.jpeg, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/1/b/2/1b248c9d14e36535e8e637bed2395852f8afd7a7_2_1035x663.jpeg 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/1/b/2/1b248c9d14e36535e8e637bed2395852f8afd7a7_2_1380x884.jpeg 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;242328&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;具体的方法刚刚看到这个佬友的分享&lt;/p&gt;&lt;aside class=&quot;quote quote-modified&quot; data-post=&quot;1&quot; data-topic=&quot;2494641&quot;&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;quote-controls&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;24&quot; height=&quot;24&quot; src=&quot;https://cdn.ldstatic.com/letter_avatar/yue357224084/48/5_ffec4c539455c0ce498261b5ece9442b.png&quot; class=&quot;avatar&quot;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;quote-title__text-content&quot;&gt;
      &lt;a href=&quot;https://linux.do/t/topic/2494641&quot;&gt;白嫖京东 50W积分，可用GLM5.2&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;badge-category__wrapper &quot; href=&quot;https://linux.do/c/domestic/98&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-category-id=&quot;98&quot; style=&quot;--category-badge-color: #D12C25; --category-badge-text-color: #FFFFFF;&quot; data-drop-close=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;badge-category --style-icon &quot; title=&quot;汇聚中国智造，推动技术自强。&quot;&gt;&lt;svg class=&quot;fa d-icon svg-icon svg-node&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;svg id=&quot;seedling&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 512 512&quot;&gt;
  &lt;path d=&quot;M512 32c0 113.6-84.6 207.5-194.2 222c-7.1-53.4-30.6-101.6-65.3-139.3C290.8 46.3 364 0 448 0l32 0c17.7 0 32 14.3 32 32zM0 96C0 78.3 14.3 64 32 64l32 0c123.7 0 224 100.3 224 224l0 32 0 160c0 17.7-14.3 32-32 32s-32-14.3-32-32l0-160C100.3 320 0 219.7 0 96z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;
&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;badge-category__name&quot;&gt;国产替代&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;blockquote&gt;
    具体的方法 
1、用京东账号登录 &lt;a href=&quot;https://joyagent.jd.com/&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;https://joyagent.jd.com/&lt;/a&gt; 
2、&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jdcloud.com/cn/pages/cloudpromotion&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;https://www.jdcloud.com/cn/pages/cloudpromotion&lt;/a&gt; 活动页面顶部点&lt;&lt; JoyAgent Hub Token积分包 后边的抢购，注意不用付款购买。 再点活动页下边的轻量云主机随便点几个抢购，注意不要付款购买。  京东云可能会提示让实名什么的，可以不用理会，我自己的账…
  &lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;/aside&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
我一直领取不成功，结果发现是自己点错地方了！ 所以出个图文的。&lt;br&gt;
应该大部分人都是新用户。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;1.登录&lt;a href=&quot;https://joyagent.jd.com/&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;https://joyagent.jd.com/&lt;/a&gt; 正常新用户登录即可&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/8/2/9/8291559c37884d13bcc78a584b232995941bdc36.jpeg&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/iD3rOPhbuqqTSrbP6dF5hkbiqCW.jpeg?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;1782716677739&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/8/2/9/8291559c37884d13bcc78a584b232995941bdc36_2_690x394.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;1782716677739&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;iD3rOPhbuqqTSrbP6dF5hkbiqCW&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;394&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/8/2/9/8291559c37884d13bcc78a584b232995941bdc36_2_690x394.jpeg, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/8/2/9/8291559c37884d13bcc78a584b232995941bdc36_2_1035x591.jpeg 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/8/2/9/8291559c37884d13bcc78a584b232995941bdc36_2_1380x788.jpeg 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;EBEDF5&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;
2.进入这个网页 &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jdcloud.com/cn/pages/cloudpromotion&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;https://www.jdcloud.com/cn/pages/cloudpromotion&lt;/a&gt;  点击这个&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/5/4/6/546b519ba579f25e57272b385a5abfcc20029deb.jpeg&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/c2O2i1hAlZ7VteGOvs7fV5WzXuj.jpeg?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;1782716747780&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/5/4/6/546b519ba579f25e57272b385a5abfcc20029deb_2_690x434.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;1782716747780&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;c2O2i1hAlZ7VteGOvs7fV5WzXuj&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;434&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/5/4/6/546b519ba579f25e57272b385a5abfcc20029deb_2_690x434.jpeg, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/5/4/6/546b519ba579f25e57272b385a5abfcc20029deb_2_1035x651.jpeg 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/5/4/6/546b519ba579f25e57272b385a5abfcc20029deb_2_1380x868.jpeg 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;E9EDF1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;
3.随后会进入这个页面 ，不必理会。&lt;br&gt;
